    "body": "\nThe bakefile syntax for `docker buildx bake` is supported by the\nlanguage server but there's no current filetype that would trigger it.\nAdds an `hcl.docker-bake` filetype that will cause the language server\nto start.\n\nTo use the configuration, you will still need to add an autocmd to set\nthe filetype since this filetype isn't included by default.\n",
